  "description": "The In-Curve Post Swing has teal posts that bend inward at the top to hold two yellow seats. That inward curve gives the frame a rounded outline, a softer look than straight posts. It suits the 6 to 12 years Key User Group and seats two. The frame is 9'1\" x 3'8\", and the safe play area is 11'2\" x 13'3\". Societies often choose this design when the play area is visible from the clubhouse or main lawn, because the shape looks neat from any angle. The colour is Horizon Teal. Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipes against manufacturing defects, and bearings and spares are covered for 1 year. Send us your site details for a quote.",
